sequenceDiagram
 participant B as Browser
 participant C as Controller / proxy
 participant P as Provider
 participant G as Guest
 participant D as Devcontainer
 B->>C: Authorized launch request
 C->>P: Reserve / provision known VM
 P->>G: Boot with scoped enrollment media
 G->>C: Fresh one-use enrollment
 G->>C: mTLS desired-state poll
 C-->>G: Identified operation in response
 G->>D: Dev Container CLI / retained mounts
 G->>C: Establish reverse tunnel
 B->>C: Authorized IDE / preview request
 C->>G: Route over existing tunnel
 G->>D: HTTP / WebSocket without management credentials
